"Penița Dreptului is a professional legal portal dedicated to criminal "
"procedural law and forensics from the Republic of Moldova. It offers "
"scientific articles and specialty books written by Tudor Osoianu and Dinu "
"Ostavciuc."
msgstr ""
"Penița Dreptului is a professional legal portal dedicated to criminal "
"procedural law and forensics from the Republic of Moldova. It offers "
"scientific articles and specialty books written by Tudor Osoianu and Dinu "
"Ostavciuc."

#: templates/index.html:322
msgid "How can I access the books and articles?"
msgstr "How can I access the books and articles?"

#: templates/index.html:323
msgid ""
"Articles are freely accessible to all visitors. Books may be free or paid; "
"for paid books an account and a secure payment via the MAIB system are "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Articles are freely accessible to all visitors. Books may be free or paid; "
"for paid books an account and a secure payment via the MAIB system are "
"required."

#: templates/index.html:326
msgid "What legal topics does the portal cover?"
msgstr "What legal topics does the portal cover?"

#: templates/index.html:328
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The portal covers three main directions: <a href=\"%(articles_url)s?"
"category=procedura_penala\">criminal procedural law</a>, <a "
"href=\"%(articles_url)s?category=criminalistica\">forensics</a> and <a "
"href=\"%(articles_url)s?category=alte_stiinte\">other related legal "
"sciences</a>, with a focus on the legislation and practice of the Republic "
"of Moldova."
msgstr ""
"The portal covers three main directions: <a href=\"%(articles_url)s?"
"category=procedura_penala\">criminal procedural law</a>, <a "
"href=\"%(articles_url)s?category=criminalistica\">forensics</a> and <a "
"href=\"%(articles_url)s?category=alte_stiinte\">other related legal "
"sciences</a>, with a focus on the legislation and practice of the Republic "
"of Moldova."

#: templates/index.html:331
msgid "Who are the authors of the materials?"
msgstr "Who are the authors of the materials?"

#: templates/index.html:333
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The materials are written by <a href=\"%(osoianu_url)s\">Tudor Osoianu</a>, "
"expert in criminal procedural law, and <a href=\"%(ostavciuc_url)s\">Dinu "
"Ostavciuc</a>, doctor habilitat in law, both with over 20 years of academic "
"and practical experience."
msgstr ""
"The materials are written by <a href=\"%(osoianu_url)s\">Tudor Osoianu</a>, "
"expert in criminal procedural law, and <a href=\"%(ostavciuc_url)s\">Dinu "
"Ostavciuc</a>, doctor habilitat in law, both with over 20 years of academic "
"and practical experience."

#: templates/index.html:336
msgid "How is payment for the books made?"
msgstr "How is payment for the books made?"

#: templates/index.html:337
msgid ""
"Payment is made online through the secure MAIB system with Visa and "
"Mastercard cards. After payment confirmation you get permanent access to the "
"purchased book in your personal account."
