msgstr "<strong>Medal „Promoter of the Culture of Quality in Education and Research”</strong>, First Class, awarded under the Order of ANACEC of 4 April 2023."

#: templates/osoianu.html:106
msgid "Tudor Osoianu is an expert in criminal procedural law, criminalistics and forensic expertise, with over 30 years of experience in teaching, research, professional training, academic evaluation and legal practice. He has been actively involved in numerous international and national projects to improve the justice reform in the Republic of Moldova."
msgstr "Tudor Osoianu is an expert in criminal procedural law, criminalistics and forensic expertise, with over 30 years of experience in teaching, research, professional training, academic evaluation and legal practice. He has been actively involved in numerous international and national projects to improve the justice reform in the Republic of Moldova."

#: templates/osoianu.html:108
msgid "He is the author and co-author of numerous monographs, university courses and scientific articles published in the Republic of Moldova, Romania, Ukraine, Poland and other recognized international publications. As a doctoral supervisor in Criminal Procedural Law, Criminalistics and Forensic Expertise, he has supervised six successfully defended PhD theses, including one PhD candidate of Romanian citizenship validated by CNRED."
msgstr "He is the author and co-author of numerous monographs, university courses and scientific articles published in the Republic of Moldova, Romania, Ukraine, Poland and other recognized international publications. As a doctoral supervisor in Criminal Procedural Law, Criminalistics and Forensic Expertise, he has supervised six successfully defended PhD theses, including one PhD candidate of Romanian citizenship validated by CNRED."

